### pixledger — requisições de exemplo (VS Code REST Client)
### Gere um token: make token  (ou: go run ./cmd/tokengen -sub dev -ttl 24h)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = COLE_SEU_TOKEN_AQUI

### Health (liveness)
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Readiness (checa o Postgres)
GET {{baseUrl}}/readyz

### Métricas Prometheus
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### Criar conta origem
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "0001-1",
  "holder": "Lucas",
  "initial_balance_cents": 100000
}

### Criar conta destino
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "0002-2",
  "holder": "Maria",
  "initial_balance_cents": 0
}

### Consultar conta (troque o UUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/accounts/COLOQUE_O_UUID_AQUI
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pix — primeira execução (201)
### Repita a MESMA requisição: volta 200 + Idempotent-Replayed: true,
### com o mesmo transaction_id, sem debitar de novo.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pix
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: pedido-123

{
  "source_account_id": "UUID_DA_ORIGEM",
  "dest_account_id": "UUID_DO_DESTINO",
  "amount_cents": 2500,
  "description": "almoço"
}

### Pix — mesma chave, payload diferente (409 idempotency_conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pix
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: pedido-123

{
  "source_account_id": "UUID_DA_ORIGEM",
  "dest_account_id": "UUID_DO_DESTINO",
  "amount_cents": 9999,
  "description": "almoço"
}

### Pix — saldo insuficiente (402 gravado; replay devolve o mesmo 402)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pix
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Idempotency-Key: pedido-sem-saldo

{
  "source_account_id": "UUID_DA_ORIGEM",
  "dest_account_id": "UUID_DO_DESTINO",
  "amount_cents": 99999999,
  "description": "acima do saldo"
}
